<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="トリックハート (feat. 重音テト)"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="MIMI"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="重音テト"/><amll:meta key="album" value="トリックハート (feat. 重音テト)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="QT66J2606858"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="3335544260"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="003sfTsH1y4abX"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="6GCa6EDgz6InGi3EcHIH70"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="1Ck0LiajnB01NfOneg0sNO"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1866102294"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Mrs4s"/></metadata></head><body dur="2:34.080"><div begin="0.501" end="2:34.080"><p begin="0.501" end="1.540" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0.501" end="0.761">こ</span><span begin="0.761" end="0.951">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="0.951" end="1.161">なん</span></span></span><span begin="1.161" end="1.240">で</span><span begin="1.240" end="1.361">も</span><span begin="1.361" end="1.460">な</span><span begin="1.460" end="1.540">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就用掌心之中</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono nandemo nai</span></p><p begin="1.551" end="3.640" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1.551" end="1.751">て</span></span></span><span begin="1.751" end="1.881">の</span><span begin="1.881" end="2.161">ひ</span><span begin="2.161" end="2.351">ら</span><span begin="2.351" end="2.541">の</span><span begin="2.541" end="2.951">カー</span><span begin="2.951" end="3.151">ド</span><span begin="3.151" end="3.251">で</span><span begin="3.251" end="3.640">さ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这张平平无奇的纸牌</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">te no hira no kādo de sa</span></p><p begin="3.751" end="6.580" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="3.751" end="4.151">１</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">度</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.151" end="4.351">ど</span></span></span><span begin="4.351" end="4.431">だ</span><span begin="4.431" end="4.560">け</span><span begin="4.560" end="4.711">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">秘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.711" end="4.961">ひ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">密</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="4.961" end="5.351">みつ</span></span></span><span begin="5.351" end="5.560">の</span><span begin="5.560" end="5.751">イ</span><span begin="5.751" end="6.081">リュー</span><span begin="6.081" end="6.330">ジョ</span><span begin="6.330" end="6.580">ン</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">上演仅此一次的秘密幻术吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ichido dake no himitsu no iryūjon</span></p><p begin="6.721" end="10.080" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">揺</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="6.721" end="6.951">ゆ</span></span></span><span begin="6.951" end="7.151">ら</span><span begin="7.151" end="7.341">め</span><span begin="7.341" end="7.741">く</span><span begin="7.741" end="8.151">ハー</span><span begin="8.151" end="8.471">ト</span><span begin="8.471" end="8.951">そっ</span><span begin="8.951" end="9.311">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">消</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="9.311" end="9.500">き</span></span></span><span begin="9.500" end="9.740">え</span><span begin="9.740" end="10.080">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">动摇的心绪在悄然间消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yurameku hāto sotto kieru</span></p><p begin="10.141" end="13.336" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.141" end="10.540">こん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.540" end="10.720">や</span></span></span><span begin="10.720" end="10.940">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">星</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="10.940" end="11.351">ほし</span></span></span><span begin="11.351" end="11.501">の</span><span begin="11.501" end="11.740">よ</span><span begin="11.740" end="11.951">う</span><span begin="11.951" end="12.141">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">開</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.141" end="12.551">かい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="12.551" end="12.951">まく</span></span></span><span begin="12.951" end="13.336">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">今天也迎来繁星璀璨般的开幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kon&apos;ya mo hoshi no yō na kaimaku de</span></p><p begin="13.751" end="16.521" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">種</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="13.751" end="14.140">たね</span></span></span><span begin="14.140" end="14.241">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.241" end="14.541">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="14.541" end="14.731">か</span></span></span><span begin="14.731" end="14.951">け</span><span begin="14.951" end="15.151">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.151" end="15.340">な</span></span></span><span begin="15.340" end="15.461">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">世</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.461" end="15.741">せ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">界</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="15.741" end="16.160">かい</span></span></span><span begin="16.160" end="16.521">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">这个没有任何花招算计的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tane mo shikake mo nai sekai o</span></p><p begin="16.521" end="18.880" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">今</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="16.521" end="16.780">きょ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="16.780" end="16.941">う</span></span></span><span begin="16.941" end="17.341">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">愛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="17.341" end="17.691">あい</span></span></span><span begin="17.691" end="17.940">せ</span><span begin="17.940" end="18.151">る</span><span begin="18.151" end="18.341">の</span><span begin="18.341" end="18.551">か</span><span begin="18.551" end="18.880">な</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">今天是否也能深爱呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kyō wa aiseru no kana</span></p><p begin="19.741" end="22.860" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="19.741" end="19.911">だ</span></span></span><span begin="19.911" end="20.031">き</span><span begin="20.031" end="20.320">し</span><span begin="20.320" end="20.460">め</span><span begin="20.460" end="20.641">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="20.641" end="20.941">うそ</span></span></span><span begin="20.941" end="21.141">み</span><span begin="21.141" end="21.360">た</span><span begin="21.360" end="21.541">い</span><span begin="21.541" end="21.741">な</span><span begin="21.741" end="21.830">ホ</span><span begin="21.830" end="21.941">ン</span><span begin="21.941" end="22.030">ト</span><span begin="22.030" end="22.101">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.101" end="22.341">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.341" end="22.860">かん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将恍若谎言般切实存在的时光铭记于心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dakishimeru uso mitai na honto no jikan</span></p><p begin="22.941" end="25.960" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="22.941" end="23.341">こと</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="23.341" end="23.551">ば</span></span></span><span begin="23.551" end="23.651">だ</span><span begin="23.651" end="23.740">け</span><span begin="23.740" end="23.911">じゃ</span><span begin="23.911" end="24.140">つ</span><span begin="24.140" end="24.370">ら</span><span begin="24.370" end="24.551">い</span><span begin="24.551" end="24.741">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="24.741" end="24.940">い</span></span></span><span begin="24.940" end="25.141">え</span><span begin="25.141" end="25.360">な</span><span begin="25.360" end="25.541">い</span><span begin="25.541" end="25.760">か</span><span begin="25.760" end="25.960">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为仅凭只言片语仍无法诉说这份痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kotoba dake ja tsurai wa ienai kara</span></p><p begin="26.141" end="29.180" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.141" end="26.351">こ</span><span begin="26.351" end="26.531">の</span><span begin="26.531" end="26.751">カー</span><span begin="26.751" end="26.851">ド</span><span begin="26.851" end="26.951">だ</span><span begin="26.951" end="27.141">け</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.141" end="27.540">なに</span></span></span><span begin="27.540" end="27.741">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="27.741" end="27.960">な</span></span></span><span begin="27.960" end="28.141">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="28.141" end="28.541">よる</span></span></span><span begin="28.541" end="28.741">だ</span><span begin="28.741" end="28.951">け</span><span begin="28.951" end="29.180">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我只有这张纸牌 尽管今夜无事发生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono kādo dake nani mo nai yoru dakedo</span></p><p begin="29.300" end="32.646" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.300" end="29.541">オ</span><span begin="29.541" end="29.681">マ</span><span begin="29.681" end="30.051">ジ</span><span begin="30.051" end="30.160">ナ</span><span begin="30.160" end="30.341">イ</span><span begin="30.341" end="30.541">み</span><span begin="30.541" end="30.760">た</span><span begin="30.760" end="30.941">い</span><span begin="30.941" end="31.141">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.141" end="31.271">て</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">品</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="31.271" end="31.720">じな</span></span></span><span begin="31.720" end="31.941">ひ</span><span begin="31.941" end="32.081">と</span><span begin="32.081" end="32.646">つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">依旧上演如同咒语般的小小魔术</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">omajinai mitai na tejina hitotsu</span></p><p begin="32.891" end="34.510" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.891" end="33.141">ちょっ</span><span begin="33.141" end="33.220">ぴ</span><span begin="33.220" end="33.291">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">寂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="33.291" end="33.481">さび</span></span></span><span begin="33.481" end="33.651">し</span><span begin="33.651" end="33.741">く</span><span begin="33.741" end="33.941">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="33.941" end="34.510">なみだ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">总觉得有些寂寞 泪水滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">choppiri sabishikute namida</span></p><p begin="34.541" end="36.141" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">零</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.541" end="34.720">こぼ</span></span></span><span begin="34.720" end="34.881">れ</span><span begin="34.881" end="34.940">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">終</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="34.940" end="35.141">しゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">末</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.141" end="35.341">まつ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">感</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.341" end="35.531">かん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="35.531" end="35.941">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="35.941" end="36.141">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">弥漫着结束的预感 而你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">koboreru shūmatsukan kimi wa</span></p><p begin="36.141" end="38.860" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.141" end="36.341">カー</span><span begin="36.341" end="36.440">ド</span><span begin="36.440" end="36.541">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">魔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.541" end="36.940">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">法</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="36.940" end="37.341">ほう</span></span></span><span begin="37.341" end="37.751">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">微</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="37.751" end="38.141">ほほえ</span></span></span><span begin="38.141" end="38.380">笑</span><span begin="38.380" end="38.541">ん</span><span begin="38.541" end="38.860">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">却在纸牌魔术中露出了微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kādo no mahō de hohoenda</span></p><p begin="38.941" end="42.461" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">種</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="38.941" end="39.320">たね</span></span></span><span begin="39.320" end="39.441">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.441" end="39.640">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="39.640" end="39.741">か</span></span></span><span begin="39.741" end="39.941">け</span><span begin="39.941" end="40.141">も</span><span begin="40.141" end="40.360">な</span><span begin="40.360" end="40.511">い</span><span begin="40.511" end="40.671">は</span><span begin="40.671" end="40.941">ず</span><span begin="40.941" end="41.151">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.151" end="41.541">こころ</span></span></span><span begin="41.541" end="41.741">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="41.741" end="42.120">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">片</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.120" end="42.360">けら</span></span></span><span begin="42.360" end="42.461">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只为找寻没有任何花招算计的心灵碎片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tane mo shikake mo nai hazu no kokoro no kakera o</span></p><p begin="42.461" end="45.280" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="42.461" end="42.941">さが</span></span></span><span begin="42.941" end="43.141">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.141" end="43.560">たび</span></span></span><span begin="43.560" end="43.751">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="43.751" end="43.960">で</span></span></span><span begin="43.960" end="44.091">る</span><span begin="44.091" end="44.541">ハー</span><span begin="44.541" end="44.741">ト</span><span begin="44.741" end="44.940">の</span><span begin="44.940" end="45.280">A</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">踏上旅程的则是那张红心A</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sagasu tabi ni deru hāto no ēsu</span></p><p begin="58.461" end="1:01.200" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="58.461" end="58.740">ちっ</span><span begin="58.740" end="58.831">ぽ</span><span begin="58.831" end="58.941">け</span><span begin="58.941" end="59.141">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">感</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.141" end="59.501">かん</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">情</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="59.501" end="59.940">じょう</span></span></span><span begin="59.940" end="1:00.121">の</span><span begin="1:00.121" end="1:00.351">キャ</span><span begin="1:00.351" end="1:00.441">パ</span><span begin="1:00.441" end="1:00.721">シ</span><span begin="1:00.721" end="1:01.200">ティ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">感情的内存实在是小到不值一提</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">chippoke na kanjō no kyapashiti</span></p><p begin="1:01.241" end="1:04.196" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">失</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.241" end="1:01.741">しっ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">敗</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:01.741" end="1:01.951">ぱい</span></span></span><span begin="1:01.951" end="1:02.041">ば</span><span begin="1:02.041" end="1:02.160">か</span><span begin="1:02.160" end="1:02.231">り</span><span begin="1:02.231" end="1:02.541">し</span><span begin="1:02.541" end="1:02.711">て</span><span begin="1:02.711" end="1:02.941">き</span><span begin="1:02.941" end="1:03.051">た</span><span begin="1:03.051" end="1:03.331">そ</span><span begin="1:03.331" end="1:03.551">れ</span><span begin="1:03.551" end="1:03.751">で</span><span begin="1:03.751" end="1:04.196">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">尽管这一路走来都在历经失败</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shippai bakari shite kita soredemo</span></p><p begin="1:04.310" end="1:07.796" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.310" end="1:04.510">あ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:04.510" end="1:04.941">した</span></span></span><span begin="1:04.941" end="1:05.271">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.271" end="1:05.751">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:05.751" end="1:06.141">ご</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:06.141" end="1:06.360">わら</span></span></span><span begin="1:06.360" end="1:06.740">え</span><span begin="1:06.740" end="1:06.951">る</span><span begin="1:06.951" end="1:07.151">ま</span><span begin="1:07.151" end="1:07.360">で</span><span begin="1:07.360" end="1:07.796">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在还未笑到明天的最后一刻前</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">ashita no saigo waraeru made wa</span></p><p begin="1:08.131" end="1:10.996" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:08.131" end="1:08.351">こ</span><span begin="1:08.351" end="1:08.541">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">種</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:08.541" end="1:08.940">たね</span></span></span><span begin="1:08.940" end="1:09.131">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:09.131" end="1:09.341">あ</span></span></span><span begin="1:09.341" end="1:09.451">か</span><span begin="1:09.451" end="1:09.701">し</span><span begin="1:09.701" end="1:09.960">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:09.960" end="1:10.131">い</span><span begin="1:10.131" end="1:10.341">け</span><span begin="1:10.341" end="1:10.560">な</span><span begin="1:10.560" end="1:10.996">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">都绝对不允许公布这张纸牌的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono tane o akashicha ikenai</span></p><p begin="1:11.231" end="1:14.020" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">少</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:11.231" end="1:11.631">すこ</span></span></span><span begin="1:11.631" end="1:11.941">し</span><span begin="1:11.941" end="1:12.160">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">痛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.160" end="1:12.541">いた</span></span></span><span begin="1:12.541" end="1:12.751">み</span><span begin="1:12.751" end="1:12.941">が</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">灯っ</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:12.941" end="1:13.541">とも</span></span></span><span begin="1:13.541" end="1:13.751">て</span><span begin="1:13.751" end="1:14.020">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">即便些许痛楚仍若隐若现</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sukoshi no itami ga tomotte mo</span></p><p begin="1:14.141" end="1:16.460" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.141" end="1:14.541">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="1:14.541" end="1:14.941">と</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:14.941" end="1:15.241">だ</span></span></span><span begin="1:15.241" end="1:15.421">き</span><span begin="1:15.421" end="1:15.741">し</span><span begin="1:15.741" end="1:15.941">め</span><span begin="1:15.941" end="1:16.141">て</span><span begin="1:16.141" end="1:16.460">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我仍会与你彼此相拥</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi to dakishimeteru</span></p><p begin="1:17.341" end="1:20.420" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">解</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:17.341" end="1:17.731">ほど</span></span></span><span begin="1:17.731" end="1:17.951">け</span><span begin="1:17.951" end="1:18.041">て</span><span begin="1:18.041" end="1:18.140">く</span><span begin="1:18.140" end="1:18.360">よ</span><span begin="1:18.360" end="1:18.551">う</span><span begin="1:18.551" end="1:18.661">に</span><span begin="1:18.661" end="1:18.960">す</span><span begin="1:18.960" end="1:19.14