n tts:ruby="text" begin="1:23.741" end="1:23.960">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:23.960" end="1:24.111">え</span><span begin="1:24.111" end="1:24.300">ちゃ</span><span begin="1:24.300" end="1:24.351">う</span><span begin="1:24.351" end="1:24.440">か</span><span begin="1:24.440" end="1:24.540">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">彻底地改换一新</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kaechau kara</span></p><p begin="1:24.540" end="1:26.900" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.540" end="1:24.740">ど</span><span begin="1:24.740" end="1:24.941">う</span><span begin="1:24.941" end="1:25.121">か</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.121" end="1:25.541">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.541" end="1:25.741">が</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:25.741" end="1:25.860">わら</span></span></span><span begin="1:25.860" end="1:26.060">え</span><span begin="1:26.060" end="1:26.141">る</span><span begin="1:26.141" end="1:26.340">よ</span><span begin="1:26.340" end="1:26.541">う</span><span begin="1:26.541" end="1:26.900">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只愿你能再次展露笑容</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dōka kimi ga waraeru yō ni</span></p><p begin="1:26.941" end="1:30.000" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">鮮</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:26.941" end="1:27.341">あざ</span></span></span><span begin="1:27.341" end="1:27.651">や</span><span begin="1:27.651" end="1:27.741">か</span><span begin="1:27.741" end="1:27.921">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">記</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:27.921" end="1:28.180">き</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">憶</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.180" end="1:28.540">おく</span></span></span><span begin="1:28.540" end="1:28.741">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">幕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:28.741" end="1:29.140">まく</span></span></span><span begin="1:29.140" end="1:29.351">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">閉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:29.351" end="1:29.471">と</span></span></span><span begin="1:29.471" end="1:29.741">じ</span><span begin="1:29.741" end="1:29.900">た</span><span begin="1:29.900" end="1:30.000">い</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">希望一切在鲜明的记忆中落下帷幕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">azayaka na kioku de maku o tojitai</span></p><p begin="1:30.461" end="1:31.560" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.461" end="1:30.741">しっ</span><span begin="1:30.741" end="1:30.850">か</span><span begin="1:30.850" end="1:30.920">り</span><span begin="1:30.920" end="1:31.060">し</span><span begin="1:31.060" end="1:31.151">ん</span><span begin="1:31.151" end="1:31.251">ど</span><span begin="1:31.251" end="1:31.351">く</span><span begin="1:31.351" end="1:31.560">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">就连让我感到无比艰难</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">shikkari shindokute</span></p><p begin="1:31.580" end="1:33.180" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">俯</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:31.580" end="1:32.130">うつむ</span></span></span><span begin="1:32.130" end="1:32.251">い</span><span begin="1:32.251" end="1:32.341">て</span><span begin="1:32.341" end="1:32.451">き</span><span begin="1:32.451" end="1:32.541">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.541" end="1:32.741">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">去</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:32.741" end="1:32.941">こ</span></span></span><span begin="1:32.941" end="1:33.180">も</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在消沉中经历的过去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">utsumuite kita kako mo</span></p><p begin="1:33.200" end="1:34.141" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:33.200" end="1:33.491">うそ</span></span></span><span begin="1:33.491" end="1:33.741">じゃ</span><span begin="1:33.741" end="1:33.860">な</span><span begin="1:33.860" end="1:33.951">い</span><span begin="1:33.951" end="1:34.040">ま</span><span begin="1:34.040" end="1:34.141">ま</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">希望我也能满怀真情实感地</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">uso ja nai mama</span></p><p begin="1:34.141" end="1:36.541" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.141" end="1:34.541">ギュッ</span><span begin="1:34.541" end="1:34.941">て</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">赦</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:34.941" end="1:35.261">ゆる</span></span></span><span begin="1:35.261" end="1:35.511">せ</span><span begin="1:35.511" end="1:35.740">る</span><span begin="1:35.740" end="1:35.960">よ</span><span begin="1:35.960" end="1:36.141">う</span><span begin="1:36.141" end="1:36.541">に</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将其铭刻于心之后尽数宽恕</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">gyutte yuruseru yō ni</span></p><p begin="1:36.541" end="1:40.071" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">種</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:36.541" end="1:36.920">たね</span></span></span><span begin="1:36.920" end="1:37.051">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.051" end="1:37.251">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:37.251" end="1:37.351">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:37.351" end="1:37.551">け</span><span begin="1:37.551" end="1:37.741">も</span><span begin="1:37.741" end="1:37.980">な</span><span begin="1:37.980" end="1:38.121">い</span><span begin="1:38.121" end="1:38.281">は</span><span begin="1:38.281" end="1:38.540">ず</span><span begin="1:38.540" end="1:38.751">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:38.751" end="1:39.141">こころ</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.141" end="1:39.341">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:39.341" end="1:39.720">か</span></span></span><span begin="1:39.720" end="1:39.960">片</span><span begin="1:39.960" end="1:40.071">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只为找寻没有任何花招算计的心灵碎片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tane mo shikake mo nai hazu no kokoro no kakera o</span></p><p begin="1:40.071" end="1:43.000" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.071" end="1:40.541">さが</span></span></span><span begin="1:40.541" end="1:40.741">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:40.741" end="1:41.160">たび</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.160" end="1:41.361">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:41.361" end="1:41.540">で</span></span></span><span begin="1:41.540" end="1:41.701">る</span><span begin="1:41.701" end="1:42.151">ハー</span><span begin="1:42.151" end="1:42.341">ト</span><span begin="1:42.341" end="1:42.501">の</span><span begin="1:42.501" end="1:43.000">J</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">踏上旅程的则是那张红心J</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sagasu tabi ni deru hāto no jakku</span></p><p begin="1:56.151" end="2:00.016" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.151" end="1:56.341">ゆっ</span><span begin="1:56.341" end="1:56.400">く</span><span begin="1:56.400" end="1:56.500">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">過</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:56.500" end="1:56.751">す</span></span></span><span begin="1:56.751" end="1:56.951">ぎ</span><span begin="1:56.951" end="1:57.131">て</span><span begin="1:57.131" end="1:57.361">く</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">日</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.361" end="1:57.701">にち</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">常</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="1:57.701" end="1:57.960">じょう</span></span></span><span begin="1:57.960" end="1:58.060">に</span><span begin="1:58.060" end="1:58.151">ほ</span><span begin="1:58.151" end="1:58.341">ど</span><span begin="1:58.341" end="1:58.560">け</span><span begin="1:58.560" end="2:00.016">る</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">在缓缓流逝的日常之中释怀了一切</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">yukkuri sugiteku nichijō ni hodokeru</span></p><p begin="2:02.451" end="2:05.300" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">最</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.451" end="2:02.751">さい</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">後</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.751" end="2:02.860">ご</span></span></span><span begin="2:02.860" end="2:02.960">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:02.960" end="2:03.360">わら</span></span></span><span begin="2:03.360" end="2:03.521">え</span><span begin="2:03.521" end="2:03.740">る</span><span begin="2:03.740" end="2:03.860">よ</span><span begin="2:03.860" end="2:03.951">う</span><span begin="2:03.951" end="2:04.141">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">種</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.141" end="2:04.360">たね</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.360" end="2:04.460">を</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">明</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:04.460" end="2:04.541">あか</span></span></span><span begin="2:04.541" end="2:04.651">か</span><span begin="2:04.651" end="2:04.941">し</span><span begin="2:04.941" end="2:05.300">て</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">最终将揭晓能让人开怀大笑的秘密</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">saigo wa waraeru yō na tane o akashite</span></p><p begin="2:05.331" end="2:08.400" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:05.331" end="2:05.741">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="2:05.741" end="2:06.040">が</span><span begin="2:06.040" end="2:06.141">ま</span><span begin="2:06.141" end="2:06.351">た</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">微</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.351" end="2:06.580">ほほ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:06.580" end="2:06.940">え</span></span></span><span begin="2:06.940" end="2:07.061">む</span><span begin="2:07.061" end="2:07.340">そ</span><span begin="2:07.340" end="2:07.541">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:07.541" end="2:07.940">とき</span></span></span><span begin="2:07.940" end="2:08.141">ま</span><span begin="2:08.141" end="2:08.400">で</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">直至你再一次露出笑容为止</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kimi ga mata hohoemu sono toki made</span></p><p begin="2:08.551" end="2:11.580" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">抱</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:08.551" end="2:08.731">だ</span></span></span><span begin="2:08.731" end="2:08.841">き</span><span begin="2:08.841" end="2:09.161">し</span><span begin="2:09.161" end="2:09.260">め</span><span begin="2:09.260" end="2:09.451">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">嘘</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:09.451" end="2:09.761">うそ</span></span></span><span begin="2:09.761" end="2:09.941">み</span><span begin="2:09.941" end="2:10.160">た</span><span begin="2:10.160" end="2:10.341">い</span><span begin="2:10.341" end="2:10.540">な</span><span begin="2:10.540" end="2:10.680">ホ</span><span begin="2:10.680" end="2:10.751">ン</span><span begin="2:10.751" end="2:10.860">ト</span><span begin="2:10.860" end="2:10.911">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">時</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:10.911" end="2:11.141">じ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">間</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.141" end="2:11.580">かん</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">将恍若谎言般切实存在的时光铭记于心</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">dakishimeru uso mitai na honto no jikan</span></p><p begin="2:11.741" end="2:14.760" itunes:key="L38" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:11.741" end="2:12.141">こと</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">葉</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:12.141" end="2:12.341">ば</span></span></span><span begin="2:12.341" end="2:12.461">だ</span><span begin="2:12.461" end="2:12.571">け</span><span begin="2:12.571" end="2:12.711">じゃ</span><span begin="2:12.711" end="2:12.940">つ</span><span begin="2:12.940" end="2:13.130">ら</span><span begin="2:13.130" end="2:13.351">い</span><span begin="2:13.351" end="2:13.541">は</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">言</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:13.541" end="2:13.760">い</span></span></span><span begin="2:13.760" end="2:13.941">え</span><span begin="2:13.941" end="2:14.160">な</span><span begin="2:14.160" end="2:14.341">い</span><span begin="2:14.341" end="2:14.560">か</span><span begin="2:14.560" end="2:14.760">ら</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">因为仅凭只言片语仍无法诉说这份痛苦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kotoba dake ja tsurai wa ienai kara</span></p><p begin="2:14.941" end="2:18.000" itunes:key="L39" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.941" end="2:15.160">こ</span><span begin="2:15.160" end="2:15.331">の</span><span begin="2:15.331" end="2:15.540">カー</span><span begin="2:15.540" end="2:15.661">ド</span><span begin="2:15.661" end="2:15.740">だ</span><span begin="2:15.740" end="2:15.941">け</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">何</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:15.941" end="2:16.340">なに</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.340" end="2:16.551">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">無</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.551" end="2:16.760">な</span></span></span><span begin="2:16.760" end="2:16.941">い</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">夜</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:16.941" end="2:17.351">よる</span></span></span><span begin="2:17.351" end="2:17.541">だ</span><span begin="2:17.541" end="2:17.761">け</span><span begin="2:17.761" end="2:18.000">ど</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">我只有这张纸牌 尽管今夜无事发生</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kono kādo dake nani mo nai yoru dakedo</span></p><p begin="2:18.141" end="2:21.260" itunes:key="L40" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.141" end="2:18.341">オ</span><span begin="2:18.341" end="2:18.501">マ</span><span begin="2:18.501" end="2:18.861">ジ</span><span begin="2:18.861" end="2:18.980">ナ</span><span begin="2:18.980" end="2:19.141">イ</span><span begin="2:19.141" end="2:19.341">み</span><span begin="2:19.341" end="2:19.560">た</span><span begin="2:19.560" end="2:19.741">い</span><span begin="2:19.741" end="2:19.941">な</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">手</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:19.941" end="2:20.081">て</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">品</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:20.081" end="2:20.520">じな</span></span></span><span begin="2:20.520" end="2:20.741">ひ</span><span begin="2:20.741" end="2:20.881">と</span><span begin="2:20.881" end="2:21.260">つ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">依旧上演如同咒语般的小小魔术</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">omajinai mitai na tejina hitotsu</span></p><p begin="2:21.691" end="2:23.340" itunes:key="L41" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:21.691" end="2:21.951">ちょっ</span><span begin="2:21.951" end="2:22.020">ぴ</span><span begin="2:22.020" end="2:22.101">り</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">寂</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.101" end="2:22.281">さび</span></span></span><span begin="2:22.281" end="2:22.441">し</span><span begin="2:22.441" end="2:22.551">く</span><span begin="2:22.551" end="2:22.751">て</span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">涙</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:22.751" end="2:23.340">なみだ</span></span></span><span ttm:role="x-translation">总觉得有些寂寞 泪水滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">choppiri sabishikute namida</span></p><p begin="2:23.351" end="2:24.920" itunes:key="L42" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">零</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.351" end="2:23.451">こぼ</span></span></span><span begin="2:23.451" end="2:23.570">れ</span><span begin="2:23.570" end="2:23.691">る</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">終</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:23.691" end="2:24.021">しゅう</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">末</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.021" end="2:24.141">まつ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">感</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.141" end="2:24.341">かん</span></span></span> <span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">君</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:24.341" end="2:24.751">きみ</span></span></span><span begin="2:24.751" end="2:24.920">は</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">弥漫着结束的预感 而你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">koboreru shūmatsukan kimi wa</span></p><p begin="2:24.940" end="2:27.820" itunes:key="L43" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:24.940" end="2:25.141">カー</span><span begin="2:25.141" end="2:25.261">ド</span><span begin="2:25.261" end="2:25.351">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">魔</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.351" end="2:25.551">ま</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">法</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:25.551" end="2:26.141">ほう</span></span></span><span begin="2:26.141" end="2:26.551">で</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">微</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.551" end="2:26.941">ほほ</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">笑</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:26.941" end="2:27.200">え</span></span></span><span begin="2:27.200" end="2:27.341">ん</span><span begin="2:27.341" end="2:27.820">だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">却在纸牌魔术中露出了微笑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">kādo no mahō de hohoenda</span></p><p begin="2:27.830" end="2:31.271" itunes:key="L44" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">種</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:27.830" end="2:28.120">たね</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.120" end="2:28.251">も</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">仕</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.251" end="2:28.440">し</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">掛</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:28.440" end="2:28.551">か</span></span></span><span begin="2:28.551" end="2:28.720">け</span><span begin="2:28.720" end="2:28.960">も</span><span begin="2:28.960" end="2:29.160">な</span><span begin="2:29.160" end="2:29.311">い</span><span begin="2:29.311" end="2:29.481">は</span><span begin="2:29.481" end="2:29.740">ず</span><span begin="2:29.740" end="2:29.941">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">心</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:29.941" end="2:30.341">こころ</span></span></span><span begin="2:30.341" end="2:30.541">の</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">欠</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.541" end="2:30.920">か</span></span></span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">片</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:30.920" end="2:31.160">けら</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.160" end="2:31.271">を</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">只为找寻没有任何花招算计的心灵碎片</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">tane mo shikake mo nai hazu no kokoro no kakera o</span></p><p begin="2:31.271" end="2:34.080" itunes:key="L45" ttm:agent="v1"><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">探</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.271" end="2:31.700">さが</span></span></span><span begin="2:31.700" end="2:31.941">す</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">旅</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:31.941" end="2:32.360">たび</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.360" end="2:32.551">に</span><span tts:ruby="container"><span tts:ruby="base">出</span><span tts:ruby="textContainer"><span tts:ruby="text" begin="2:32.551" end="2:32.760">で</span></span></span><span begin="2:32.760" end="2:32.901">る</span><span begin="2:32.901" end="2:33.320">ハー</span><span begin="2:33.320" end="2:33.541">ト</span><span begin="2:33.541" end="2:33.780">の</span><span begin="2:33.780" end="2:34.080">A</span><span ttm:role="x-translation">而踏上旅程的则是那张红心A</span><span ttm:role="x-roman">sagasu tabi ni deru hāto no ēsu</span></p></div></body></tt>